      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm starting a new series on my philosophy blog about \"modern morality\" and how ethics are changing. I want to do a post on what it actually means to be a \"good citizen\" today. \n\nIf you had to define the most important virtues for a citizen living in a multicultural, digital-age democracy, what would they be?",
